A||||4||jlruiz67||help with exhaust  problem ||||4||
Z||000000||jlruiz67||01-25-2001||05:23 PM||||The problem I have is that I have to replace the bolts and gasket that connects the rear (close to the trunk)exhaust manifold and the Y pipe, Does anyone know the size of the bolts? I just got the gasket and can't find the bolts. no one will tell me the size and I think that they don't even know. Next, Has anyone replaced this before? any pointers so I can keep the bolts?  Any Help would be great.<P>Thanks all||||reg||4
Z||000001||KissMySSFiero||01-25-2001||06:03 PM||||doyou have an autozone near you.  thats where i went.  just ask for the donut gasket over the counter.  take yours tomatch it.  and they have a help section.  thats where i found the manifold bolts.  i think its was around $5 for each part.  if you dont have an autozone most parts places have a "help" section for misc oddball things.<BR>good luck<P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:KissMySSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:KissMySSFiero@netzero.net">KissMySSFiero@netzero.net</A>   <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">       <BR>"There's a fine line between love and beer"<BR><A HREF="http://expage.com/kissmyssfiero" TARGET=_blank>KissMySSFiero.mywebsite.hehe</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||theogre||01-25-2001||07:50 PM||||The red HELP! packages are from MotorMite. It varies just what diferant stores stock in them.<P>Everything in Fiero is metric. that narows it down at least. take what is left of you old bolts with you and match them up. the bolts to the manifold are just a plain bolt. Shouldn't be hard to find. The spring bolts are available thru HELP!||||reg||1
Z||000003||Mark||01-25-2001||07:59 PM||||The two bolts that connect the rear (and also the front) manifold to the wye pipe are M8 x 1.25 x 50mm (about 2" long).  This is a pretty common metric bolt size.||||reg||1
Z||000004||jlruiz67||01-25-2001||08:16 PM||||Thanks guy's thanks for the info now I can start my search for parts. I don't have autozone close by but I will search for them ||||reg||1
